.Dd July 24, 2026
.Dt AUXFAN 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm auxfan
.Nd Sun Blade 2500 Silver fan sensor
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "auxfan* at iic? addr?"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver provides support for the SUNW,i2c-auxfan1 sensor found on Sun Blade
2500 Silver machines.
The sensor reports the speed of the fan for the DIMM slots.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr iic 4 ,
.Xr intro 4
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in
.Nx 11.1 .
.Sh AUTHORS
The
.Nm
driver was written by
.An Julian Coleman Aq Mt jcoleman@NetBSD.org .
